OL,3,GNEWSABurnham calls summit of Welsh,
OL,4,AScottish and Northern Irish first
OL,5,Aministers
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham says he will bring
OL,8,Ftogether the leaders of Wales, Scotland
OL,9,Fand Northern Ireland in the autumn for
OL,10,Fa summit to help boost the UK economy.
OL,12,FHe made the announcement ahead of a
OL,13,Fvisit to south Wales on Thursday - his
OL,14,Ffirst official visit to the country
OL,15,Fsince he became prime minister.
OL,17,FBurnham said he wanted "every leader in
OL,18,Fthis country signed up" to having "good
OL,19,Fjobs in every community".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
